  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 e ahiloe holim'a software ea mohloli o bulehileng e ngotsoeng ke batho. E thathamisitsoe mona hobane ha e a etsoa ke AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ke morero o hlahisitsoeng ka botlalo ke AI.<\/0> Mola o mong le o mong oa khoutu ea Orion-81 ka boeona o ngotsoe ka Claude Code, tlas'a tataiso ea mothehi. Sekepe se seng le se seng, mmapa, sebopeho le modumo li hlahisitsoe ke lisebelisoa tseo Claude Code e li ngotseng. Mothehi o etsa qeto ea hore na ho hahoe eng; Claude Code e fumana hore na ho etsoe joang. Lilaebrari tsa mohloli o bulehileng tseo e ahiloeng holim'a tsona li thathamisitsoe ka tlase tlas'a 'Ha ho entsoe ke AI'. Ntho e le 'ngoe e ntse e butsoe 'me e bontšoa ka phatlalatso: <1>tlhahlobo ea laesense<\/1> ea khoutu ea papali e tsoang prototype ea GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion e qalile ka la 28 September 2026 e le prototype holim'a enjene ea mohloli o bulehileng ea Quake III Arena (GPL), ka likepe tsa Elite Dangerous e le tšusumetso ea eona. Ka letsatsi la bobeli khoutu ea papali e fetetse ho BuB, enjene e ncha e ngotsoeng ka Claude Code; li-module tsa papali li tlisitsoe ho tsoa prototype 'me tsa reoa bocha. Phatlalatso ea 0.3.0 e file lihlopha tsohle tse 16 tsa likepe li-hull tse ncha tsa tsona. Tlhahlobo ea ho latela laesense e hlahloba hore na ho na le khoutu e ntseng e tsoa ho GPL ea mantlha, le hore na meralo ea pele ea likepe e haufi haholo le tšusumetso ea eona. Skena ea othomathike ea ho tšoana ha khoutu le mohloli oa prototype ea GPL e entsoe ka la 8 October 2026, 'me tlhahlobo ea litsebi ea liphetho tsa eona e ntse e tsoela pele. Se seng le se seng se tsoang kantle se tla ngoloa bocha kapa sa rerisoa bocha.",
  "ai.prevEvent": "Ketsahalo e fetileng",
  "ai.quakeIiiArena": "Quake III Arena le Elite Dangerous ke matshwao a khoebo a beng ba tsona. Orion-81 ha e amane le bona 'me ha e tsejoe ke bona.",
