  "economy.diagram.cosmetics": "Mekhabiso",
  "economy.diagram.currencyLine": "chelete",
  "economy.diagram.desc": "Tsela ea ho fumana: bapala lipapali, fumana chelete ea papali. Tsela ea ho reka: chelete ea 'nete e reka chelete ea papali. Litsela tsena ka bobeli li isa sebakeng se le seng: likepe, ntlafatso ea likepe le mekhabiso, ebe ho khutlela papaling. E rerilwe, ha e so hahuoe.",
