  "economy.showEarn": "Bonts'a tsela ea ho fumana",
  "economy.showEarnSub": "Bapala lipapali, fumana chelete ea papali",
  "economy.todayHead": "Se leng teng kajeno",
  "economy.todayLead": "Maemo a hull le thebe a skrini sa LOADOUT le mebala ea thebe (0.6.0) a bontša mofuta oa ntlafatso le mokhabiso oo moruo o reretsoeng ho o fana.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Hobane chelete eo e e fumanang e reretsoe ho ba lefa. Papali e qala e entsoe ka botlalo ke AI e le hore e ka ba teng ho hang; bakhabisi ba lefshoang ba tla nka sebaka sa mosebetsi oa AI, ba boleloa ka mabitso.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Na nka bapala marang-rang?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Na ho bapalloa mahala?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Lipotso",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Che ha joale. Papali ea batho ba bangata ea LAN marang-rang a le mong e sebetsa kajeno (ho tloha ho 0.2.0); papali ea marang-rang ha e so hahuoe.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype e hahiloe holim'a enjene ea mohloli o bulehileng ea Quake III Arena (GPL) 'me ea nka likepe tsa Elite Dangerous e le tšusumetso. Ka letsatsi la bobeli khoutu ea papali e fetetse ho BuB, enjene e ncha e ngotsoeng ka Claude Code; li-module tsa papali li tlisitsoe ho tsoa prototype 'me tsa reoa bocha. Phatlalatso ea 0.3.0 e file lihlopha tsohle tse 16 tsa likepe li-hull tse ncha. Tlhahlobo ea ho latela laesense e hlahloba hore na ho na le khoutu e ntseng e tsoa ho GPL ea mantlha le hore na meralo ea pele ea likepe e haufi haholo le tšusumetso ea eona. Skena ea othomathike ea ho tšoana ha khoutu le mohloli oa prototype ea GPL e entsoe ka <0/>, 'me tlhahlobo ea litsebi ea liphetho tsa eona e ntse e tsoela pele. Se seng le se seng se tsoang kantle se tla ngoloa bocha kapa sa rerisoa bocha. Ho fihlela tlhahlobo e fela, ha re bolele hore karabo ke che.",
  "faq.questions": "Lipotso",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Likepe, bonono, kopano le tse ling, ha chelete e lumella. <0>Buka e leqepheng lena<\/0> e thathamisa ntho e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe 'me e tla bontša ho nkela sebaka ho hong le ho hong le moqapi oa sona.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Likepe le lintlafatso li rerilwe ho ba tse ka fumanoang ka ho bapala kapa tsa rekoa. Kamoo likepe tse lefshoang li lulang li lekane ka teng ntoeng ea molaoli khahlanong le molaoli e ntse e rerisoa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ke moralo oo: ho bapalloa mahala ka chelete ea papali e ikhethileng le mekhabiso. Ha e so hahuoe.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Na mosebetsi oa motho leha e le ofe o kopilitsoe?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "E tla tsoa neng, 'me ho eng?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Batho ba tla nka sebaka sa likarolo life, 'me nka tseba joang?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Ke hobaneng papali e entsoeng ke AI e ka thusa bakhabisi?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Na e tla ba ea ho lefa ho hapa?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC ea Windows. Ha ho letsatsi la ho tsoa le theko ho fihlela joale.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude le Claude Code ke matshwao a khoebo a Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine le Epic Games ke matshwao a khoebo a Epic Games, Inc. Blender ke letshwao la khoebo la Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena le Elite Dangerous ke matshwao a khoebo a beng ba tsona. Mabitso kaofela ke a beng ba ona 'me a sebelisoa feela ho supa lihlahisoa tse boleloang. Orion-81 ha e amane, ha e tšehetsoe kapa ha e tsejoe ke leha e le efe ea tsona.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ke tšepo feela. Ha ho tšebelisano, kamano kapa tumello e teng.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Sechaba se a tla",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog ho YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Latela Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Balekane ba isa tla?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Ha ho li-tracker. Ha ho li-cookie. Sebaka sa pontšo. Qetello e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe e latela polokelo ea morero; ha ho letho mona le leng tlhahiso kapa tšepiso.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ha e so phele",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ntho e le 'ngoe e ntse e butsoe: <0>tlhahlobo ea laesense<\/0> ea khoutu ea papali e tsoang prototype ea GPL. Skena ea othomathike ea ho tšoana ha khoutu le mohloli oa prototype e entsoe ka <1/>, 'me tlhahlobo ea litsebi ea liphetho tsa eona e ntse e tsoela pele.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ke morero o hlahisitsoeng ka botlalo ke AI.<\/0> Khoutu ea Orion-81 ka boeona e entsoe ke Claude Code, tlas'a tataiso ea mothehi; likepe, limmapa, libopeho le medumo li hlahisitsoe ke lisebelisoa tseo Claude Code e li ngotseng. Lilaebrari tsa mohloli o bulehileng tseo e li sebelisang li thathamisitsoe tlas'a <1>'Ha ho entsoe ke AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Maoto a sebaka",
